      "quote": "A civil prisoner or an \nunconvicted criminal prisoner shall be permitted to maintain himself, and to purchase, or \nreceive from private sources at proper hours, food, clothing, bedding or other necessaries, but \nsubject to examination and to such rules as may be approved by the 2[Director of Prisons].",
